Note on the art style

The textures and models in this repository are original work. Their style follows the
Kaleidoscope (森罗物语) series, whose art is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 by the Kaleidoscope
Official Production Team. No asset file from that project is copied, traced or redistributed
here; only its visual rules were studied to keep this addon's art consistent with it.

If you reuse this project's art, crediting "style after Kaleidoscope 森罗物语系列" is
appreciated.
